your only tools to climb, jump, and escape other players.\n\nSHINY ROCKS & COSMETICS: Earn in-game currency as you play to unlock a massive catalog of epic cosmetics to customize your gorilla and show off your unique style.\n\nCUSTOM ROOMS & REGIONS: Instantly create and host private rooms using simple codes, broadcast your lobbies, and hang out with friends globally.\n\nFREQUENT UPDATES: Dive into fresh features, seasonal map rotations, and exciting new items designed to keep the chase thrilling.", "short_description": "CHIMPANZEE TAGGERS\n\nSwing, run, and scale your way to victory in Chimpanzee Taggers, the ultimate fast-paced physics-based multiplayer tag game! Created by 4ever, this game takes high-speed chase mechanics to the next level with incredibly smooth locomotion, customizable lobbies, and non-stop action.\n\n\ud83c\udf1f GAME FEATURES:\n\nCLASSIC LOCOMOTION: Master the iconic physics-based movement where your arms are your only tools to climb, jump, and escape other players."}]}, "developer_name": "Onion", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1kXqwtGWBD9fWiW06yY0FcuBgGJd_TOTDV5AA-TJrFNY/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Onion", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1V8eTZp7zPJ1Sf_aAXQgh1DtI5fTk_KH0KaAY4bznG38/edit?usp=sharing", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracki